UUID: dda724b1-81c3-34b4-9c1b-d43289de071b
The module includes coke oven gas and blast furnace gas. The module uses the average net efficiency of industrial gas power plants in NORDEL countries (estimated from IEA 2001, including countries FI, NO, SE).
Location: undefined
Technology: Average of installed power plants.
